l_filename:`This heading's accessible name ("{{name}}") is a file name rather than a description of the content it introduces.`,headingQuality_summary_cantTell_url:`This heading's accessible name ("{{name}}") is a web address rather than a description of the content it introduces.`,headingQuality_hint_cantTell:"Rewrite the heading so it names the topic or purpose of the content that follows it.",linkNameQuality_title:"Link text should be descriptive, not generic",linkNameQuality_description:'Flags links whose full accessible name is a known non-descriptive phrase (e.g. "click here", "read more", "more") or a bare file-format name (e.g. "HTML", "PDF") with no adjacent context naming what it leads to, for manual review of whether the purpose is clear. English phrases are always recognized, and German, Spanish, French or Japanese ones when the link is in that language.',linkNameQuality_summary_cantTell:`This link's name ("{{name}}") is a generic phrase that doesn't say where it leads.`,linkNameQuality_hint_cantTell:'Make the link text say where it leads or what it does, such as "Download the 2026 pricing guide" rather than "Download", or check that the text around it already makes that clear.',linkNameQuality_summary_cantTell_formatName:`This link's name ("{{name}}") gives a file format but not which document it is.`,linkNameQuality_hint_cantTell_formatName:'Name the document in the link text, or in text or a heading tied to the link, such as "Download the annual report (HTML)" rather than a bare "HTML".',report_title_default:"surea11y scan report",report_generated:"generated {{date}}",report_noUrl:"(no url)",report_meta_rulesRun:"rules run",report_meta_totalOccurrences:"total occurrences",report_meta_engine:"engine",report_meta_schemaVersion:"schema version",report_meta_target:"target",report_meta_profile:"profile",report_meta_optInRules:"opt-in rules",report_meta_viewport:"viewport",report_meta_colorScheme:"color scheme",report_meta_fonts:"web fonts",report_meta_layo